# 🧠 Remember

```text
docker build
     ↓
IMAGE
     ↓
docker tag
     ↓
USERNAME/IMAGE:TAG
     ↓
docker push
     ↓
DOCKER HUB
     ↓
docker pull
     ↓
SERVER
     ↓
docker run
     ↓
CONTAINER
```

### Push vs Pull

```text
push = Local → Registry

pull = Registry → Local
```

### Image vs Tag

```text
docker-demo:v1

docker-demo = Image/Repository
v1          = Tag
```

